flowchart LR
    A[Target User Sees HallPass Landing Page] --> B[Reads Campus Information Problem and HallPass Value Proposition]
    B --> C[Clicks HallPass Call-to-Action]
    C --> D[Opens HallPass Prototype Demo or Main Workflow]
    D --> E[Browses Dormitories / Cafeterias / Campus Guides / Submits a Review]
    E --> F[HallPass Acquisition Metric Recorded]
    F --> G[Team Reviews HallPass Acquisition and Feedback]
    G --> H[Improve HallPass Message, CTA, or Prototype]
